# Declared release/audit toolchain — the tools `make audit` and `make dist-check`
# invoke, mirroring the pip-audit and package-metadata CI workflows.
#
# EDIT THIS FILE, then run `python3 scripts/lock_toolchain.py` to regenerate the
# hash-pinned `release-tools.txt` beside it.
#
# `make venv` never installed these, so both targets failed on a fresh checkout
# until you worked out by hand which tool was missing. They are pinned here for
# the same reason as everything else: a `twine check --strict` or `pyroma`
# release gate whose verdict changes on an upstream release is not a gate.
#
# Resolved for Python 3.12.
build
twine
check-wheel-contents
pyroma
pip-audit
